      "text": "# dsh-usage-indicator bundle patch.\n# One dual-face row: the node half (lib/index.js) polls the DeepSeek balance\n# API and serves /api/usage-indicator; the browser half (lib/client.js)\n# renders the sidebar card above Settings plus a settings section.\n#\n# Config values here are the composition base; the user layer\n# ($DSH_HOME/settings.yaml, namespace usage-indicator) overrides them and is\n# edited through the plugin's own Settings section.\n- insert:\n    - id: usage-indicator\n      name: 'dsh-usage-indicator'\n      config:\n        apiKeyEnv: DEEPSEEK_API_KEY\n        refreshIntervalMs: 60000\n        thresholdRatio: 0.8\n        fullBalance: 100\n        warnBalance: 20\n"
